<http://data.silknow.org/object/5a4e449a-e7bf-3fdd-be7a-56bb3d229a10/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The outward facing crown and brim of this hat are made up of brushed beaver felt. There is a decorative velvet ribbon band and a Peterham ribbon trim on the brim which covers a wire. On the underside of the brim is a plain weave cotton which covers a shellacked canvas. The wire and shellacked canvas strengthen the shape of the hat. Inside the hat's crown is a golden coloured silk which is glued to the body of the hat. There is a leather sweatband which is handsewn in the body of the hat."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5a4e449a-e7bf-3fdd-be7a-56bb3d229a10> .

